The '''Wither Skeleton''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Stronghold}} in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. It has {{Stat|hp|300K}}, and deals {{Stat|damage|2000}}. They take extra damage from the {{Item|Wither Bow}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Wither Skeletons''' spawn in the {{Zone|Stronghold}} in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Wither Skeletons''' wander when idle, but sprint to attack players from as far as 32 blocks, if their line of sight is not obstructed. When the player is attacked by a Wither Skeleton, they are inflicted with the {{Black|'''Wither'''}} effect for 10 seconds.

